WHAT IS THIS PROJECT?
---------------------
CareerSetu AI is a smart resume website.

It helps users:

• Upload resume  
• Get ATS score  
• Improve bullets  
• Generate summary  
• Create cover letter  
• Build a clean structured resume  
• Export PDF / DOCX  

In simple words:

It is a “Resume Improvement Machine”.

------------------------------------------------------------

WHY THIS PROJECT?
------------------
Most resumes get rejected because:

• Bad formatting  
• Weak bullet points  
• No keywords  
• Not ATS friendly  
• Poor cover letters  

CareerSetu AI fixes all of that automatically.

